<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivars softens to 471.00/471.75/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivars softens to 471.00/471.75/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar softened gently to 471.00/471.75 in quiet trade that was only watched by the Central Bank, traders said.</p>
<p>The unit closed at 470.50/471.50 per dollar on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;In general, it was a well-balanced market that the Central Bank only monitored, it didn't intervene,&quot; said one trader at a major bank.</p>
<p>-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
